        "heading": "PUTTING TUTOR",
        "tagline": "Start it on line — and feel a better roll.",
        "lede": "Set up a few short putts and watch the start. Offline means the face or path drifted. On line with a quieter stroke means you’re building rolls that hold. No green required to get useful reps in.",
